<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Notis - Uppdateringar för tillägg</mj-title>
    <mj-font name="Roboto" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:300,500"></mj-font>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif"></mj-all>
      <mj-text font-weight="300" font-size="16px" color="#616161" line-height="24px"></mj-text>
      <mj-section padding="0px"></mj-section>
    </mj-attributes>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body>
    <mj-section>
      <mj-column width="30%">
        <mj-image src="https://www.simrishamn.se/images/18.17f76b1d185fe62c44b8e9db/1676445792061/simrishamn-logo-kvadratisk.svg"></mj-image>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section padding="20px">
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text align="center" font-weight="500" padding="0px" font-size="18px">##lang.plugins_updates_available##</mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section padding="20px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-table>
          <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #ecedee;text-align:left;padding:15px 0;">
            <th style="padding: 0 15px 0 0;">Namn</th>
            <th style="padding: 0 15px;">Gammal version</th>
            <th style="padding: 0 0 0 15px;">Ny version</th>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0 15px 0 0;">##plugin.name##</td>
            <td style="padding: 0 15px;">##plugin.old_version##</td>
            <td style="padding: 0 0 0 15px;">##plugin.version##</td>
          </tr>
          
        </mj-table>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-section padding="20px">
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text>
          <p style="font-weight: 500">Vad gör jag nu?</p>
          <p>Om du vill uppdatera tilläggen kan du <a href="##marketplace.url##" style="color: #3498db">klicka här för att öppna inställningarna och visa installerade tillägg</a>. Där kan du sedan uppdatera dem.</p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
      <mj-column width="100%">
        <mj-text padding="0 25px">
          <p style="color: #bdbdbd; line-height: 9px">Vänligen - <a href="https://glpi.simrishamn.int" style="color: #3498db"> Helpdesken </a></p>
          <p style="font-style: italic; color: #bdbdbd; line-height: 9px">Simrishamns kommun</p>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
